"e06_1" [label=<<B>Ned orders<BR/>Gregor&#x27;s arrest<BR/>and summons Tywin</B><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="12"><B>E01</B> · B1 · S1E6</FONT>>, shape=box, fillcolor="#F5F0E5", fontcolor="#243449", peripheries=1, tooltip="Ned Stark orders Lord Beric Dondarrion to arrest Gregor Clegane and summons Tywin Lannister to answer for Gregor's actions. | Equation: U_e06_1 | Reference: Declared comparison assumption: absence of the Boolean event \"Ned Stark orders Lord Beric Dondarrion to arrest Gregor Clegane and summons Tywin Lannister to answer for Gregor's actions.\" | Final source critique: Passage s01e06_p02 explicitly states Ned orders Beric to arrest Gregor and summons Tywin. Time code 106 matches episode 6.", color="#8A9AAA"];
"e06_2" [label=<<B>Joffrey&#x27;s<BR/>parentage<BR/>revelation</B><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="12"><B>E02</B> · B1 · S1E6</FONT>>, shape=box, fillcolor="#F5F0E5", fontcolor="#243449", peripheries=1, tooltip="Ned Stark realizes Joffrey is not Robert's son after analyzing Arryn's research and Sansa's remarks. | Equation: U_e06_2 | Reference: Declared comparison assumption: absence of the Boolean event \"Ned Stark realizes Joffrey is not Robert's son after analyzing Arryn's research and Sansa's remarks.\" | Final source critique: Passage s01e06_p02 explicitly states Ned realizes Joffrey is not Robert's son via Sansa's remarks and Arryn's research. Time code 106 matches episode 6.", color="#8A9AAA"];
