"e06_3" [label=<<B>Robert&#x27;s altered<BR/>will</B><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="12"><B>E04</B> · B1 · S1E7</FONT>>, shape=box, fillcolor="#EDF5F8", fontcolor="#243449", peripheries=1, tooltip="Ned Stark writes 'my rightful heir' instead of 'Joffrey' in Robert Baratheon's will, rejecting the Lannister-arranged succession. | Equation: if(e06_2, 1, 0) | Reference: Declared comparison assumption: absence of the Boolean event \"Ned Stark writes 'my rightful heir' instead of 'Joffrey' in Robert Baratheon's will, rejecting the Lannister-arranged succession.\" | Final source critique: Passage s01e07_p05 explicitly states Ned writes 'my rightful heir' in Robert's will. Time code 107 matches episode 7. Parent e06_2 (time 106) precedes this event.", color="#8A9AAA"];
"e12_3" [label=<<B>Robb deceives<BR/>Lannister scout</B><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="12"><B>E05</B> · B1 · S1E8</FONT>>, shape=box, fillcolor="#EDF5F8", fontcolor="#243449", peripheries=1, tooltip="Robb sends a captured Lannister scout to falsely claim 20,000 men against Tywin | Equation: if(e06_0, 1, 0) | Reference: specific comparison state | Final source critique: Passage explicitly states Robb sends a captured Lannister scout to falsely claim 20,000 men (s01e08_p03). Time (108) matches episode 8. No conflicting claims.", color="#8A9AAA"];
